    "common": "The file is read as UTF-8 without BOM and with LF line endings. Braces and quotes inside comments and literals are skipped. Then every line loses its leading and trailing white space, empty lines are dropped, runs of blanks and tabs become one space, lines are joined with LF, and the sha256 of the bytes is written in lower-case hexadecimal. Comments are kept."
